{"id":"n70522-1-16","stage":3,"title":"예상 · 预想","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n70522-1-16-1","ko":"어제 축구 경기에서 우리 반이 일 반에게 완패했어.","zh":"昨天在足球比赛中，我们班被一班彻底打败了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어제","meaning":"昨天，昨日","explanation":"어제：昨天，昨日。","readings":[{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67075","senseId":"1","lemma":"어제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어제","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3"}},{"text":"축구","meaning":"足球","explanation":"축구：足球。","readings":[{"term":"축구","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36700","senseId":"1","lemma":"축구","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"축구","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3"}},{"text":"경기에서","meaning":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","explanation":"경기：竞技，比赛，竞赛；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"경기","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60094","senseId":"1","lemma":"경기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"경기에서","audio":"/audio/5be3049a0b217f8821b8.mp3"}},{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}},{"text":"반이","meaning":"班，班级","explanation":"반：班，班级；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57301","senseId":"2","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반이","audio":"/audio/50b1f05f49d3721e2c1d.mp3"}},{"text":"일","meaning":"一","explanation":"일：一。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31523","senseId":"1","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}},{"text":"반에게","meaning":"班，班级","explanation":"반：班，班级；에게：格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。","readings":[{"term":"반","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57301","senseId":"2","lemma":"반","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반에게","audio":"/audio/367f9bf1c47eb7b4c3ab.mp3"}},{"text":"완패했어.","meaning":"完败，惨败","explanation":"완패하다：完败，惨败；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"완패하다","audio":"/audio/ed5cf828272e59e8a0c8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68584","senseId":"1","lemma":"완패하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"완패했어","audio":"/audio/d29bfb4c14b098f764dd.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"79c5ada11647bce6","term":"어제","zh":"昨天，昨日","audio":"/audio/79c5ada11647bce64407.mp3","entryId":"67075","definition":"今天的前一天。","pronunciation":["어제"]},{"id":"c21dee4a35ad739c","term":"축구","zh":"足球","audio":"/audio/c21dee4a35ad739ca03e.mp3","entryId":"36700","definition":"由11人组成一队，主要用脚或头把球打入对方球门的比赛，进球多的一方获胜。","pronunciation":["축꾸"]},{"id":"e56314e9a18b80c1","term":"경기","zh":"竞技，比赛，竞赛","audio":"/audio/e56314e9a18b80c16a81.mp3","entryId":"60094","definition":"互相比较运动或技术等的能力。","pronunciation":["경ː기"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"9f12e26e8d4c016a","term":"반","zh":"班，班级","audio":"/audio/9f12e26e8d4c016af246.mp3","entryId":"57301","definition":"学校里把一个年级以教室为单位划分的团体。","pronunciation":["반"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"一","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"31523","definition":"数数时第一个数目。","pronunciation":["일"]},{"id":"ed5cf828272e59e8","term":"완패하다","zh":"完败，惨败","audio":"/audio/ed5cf828272e59e8a0c8.mp3","entryId":"68584","definition":"完全输掉。","pronunciation":["완패하다"]}],"audio":"/audio/30bdb434d94572cf8f65.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n70522-1-16-2","ko":"뭐? 이런